## What to deliver

Build the royal-jelly sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: frame 0 a glowing green jelly node with a
bright core, frame 1 the same node as a dull, dimmed husk — the two reading
clearly as before/after of one node. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded
per-frame action logs are your finished submission.
